Z||000003||Uaana||05-23-2000||02:49 AM||||O.K. nobody kill me!<BR>I think the red one don't look half bad and if it's at all modded out engine wise then not a bad package. As for the orange one ya gotta admit thats some nice looking spray work. As for the low rider hey to each his own, that car shows alot of detail work went into it. <BR>Now to really commit suicide....<BR>I don't like harley's! Damn loud ass oil dripping pigs setting off car alarms while cruising by at 10mph... But alot of guys spend alot of time putting their personal touches on them and I can appreciate that.<P>forgive me I think I'm just suffering from all the flames on the board lately and it finally came out..<BR>Can't we all just get along?||||reg||8
