Z||000005||SpeedPhreak||05-23-2000||03:49 PM||||i agree the del sol looks alright & whats that other red car?  it looks decent as well.  the orange car is a good paint job, ive seen better but i have seen much much worse.  the green car is pathetic though. <P>i aint against japanese performance.. if it is a performance car.. ie nsx, skyline (1 bad a$$ car).  even a del sol or 2.  supra's some celica's, & subaru rally cars are pretty phatty to kid  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  its the stickered out, huge as$ wing ridin, wanna be hardcore posuers that i cant stand (car & driver).  if i was rich to have a garage full of cars i would have a speciman or 2 of QUALITY rice.||||reg||1
Z||000006||DRH||05-23-2000||04:17 PM||||uaana has a point... I have to respect anything that someone put that amount of work in to. Might not be something I would do or even like... But, I still have to respect it.<P>Don't agree on HDs thjough...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> I LOVE the sound of a nice HD... Hard to justify the price though. A friend of mine has a Honda HD knockoff (complete with all his custom touches). Nice bike, looks and sounds very, very, very close to a HD. They even went so far as to NOT put any visible Honda emblems on it from the factory. He paid less than half what a comparable HD would cost (Plus no oil puddle on the garage floor). Leave it to Japan to take an American idea and improve on it (again)...<P>||||reg||1
